WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.025
The Local Group among its neighbours.

00:02.740 --> 00:06.927
Twenty-five million light-years out, the whole Local Group is the knot in the middle.

00:07.435 --> 00:11.065
Around it are eight hundred nearby galaxies from one catalogue.

00:11.660 --> 00:17.102
The brighter points have measured distances; the fainter grey-blue ones are only estimates.
